<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico injects 385 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico injects 385 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned one single credit auction whereby it sought to inject 385 million pesos in the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions was assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	    TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    385 million pesos   1 day    22.99 pct</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
